.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Portrait_Popper.png/50px-Portrait_Popper.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Popper\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Portrait_Popper.png/25px-Portrait_Popper.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Portrait_Popper.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Popper\" title=\"Popper\">Popper</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Circus_of_the_Last_Days\" title=\"Circus of the Last Days\">Circus of the Last Days</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Roah_Moonglow\" title=\"Roah Moonglow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png/25px-Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png/38px-Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png/50px-Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Roah Moonglow\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png/25px-Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Roah_Moonglow\" title=\"Roah Moonglow\">Roah Moonglow</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Sanctum\" title=\"Shattered Sanctum\">Shattered Sanctum</a> and on the Main Floor of <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stylin%27_Horst\" title=\"Stylin' Horst\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Horst.png/25px-Portrait_Horst.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Horst.png/38px-Portrait_Horst.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Horst.png/50px-Portrait_Horst.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stylin' Horst\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Horst.png/25px-Portrait_Horst.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Portrait_Horst.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stylin%27_Horst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stylin' Horst\">Stylin' Horst</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/The_Velveteen_Elixir\" title=\"The Velveteen Elixir\">The Velveteen Elixir</a>, the floor above <a href=\"/wiki/Danthelon%27s_Dancing_Axe\" title=\"Danthelon's Dancing Axe\">Danthelon's Dancing Axe</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Unlike other arrows, these do not deal weapon damage</li>\n<li>Unlike other saving throws to resist forceful movement from sources like <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder\" title=\"Arrow of Roaring Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder\" title=\"Arrow of Roaring Thunder\">Arrow of Roaring Thunder</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Telekinesis\" title=\"Telekinesis\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/20px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/30px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/40px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Telekinesis\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/20px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Telekinesis\" title=\"Telekinesis\">Telekinesis</a>, smokepowder arrows impose a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Dexterity_Small_Icon.png/25px-Dexterity_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Dexterity_Small_Icon.png/38px-Dexterity_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Dexterity_Small_Icon.png/50px-Dexterity_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dexterity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Dexterity_Small_Icon.png/25px-Dexterity_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Dexterity_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> save instead of a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/25px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/38px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/50px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Strength\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/25px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> save</li>\n<li>Consumes entire action, even if the archer could ordinarily make multiple attacks</li>\n<li>Does not explode if placed on the ground and destroyed or ignited</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714194756\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.122 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.127 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6746/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 76462/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 24295/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 12/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1381009/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   98.211      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%   98.211      1 -total\n 52.86%   51.916     27 Template:Icon_text\n 45.15%   44.340     76 Template:Trim\n 31.64%   31.075     19 Template:Icon_link\n 27.61%   27.113     13 Template:CharLink\n 13.23%   12.996     29 Template:Ifempty\n 11.40%   11.192      3 Template:Uid\n 11.14%   10.943     29 Template:Icon\n  6.79%    6.665    